  journal  = "arXiv [hep-th]",
  abstract = "It was conjectured thirty years ago that gravity could arise from
              the entropic re-arrangement of information. In this paper, we
              offer a set of microscopic quantum models which realize this idea
              in detail. In particular, we suggest a simple mechanism by which
              Newton's law of gravity arises from extremization of the free
