  abstract = "We investigate the space-time geometry generated by compact
              objects in (2+1)-dimensional Bopp-Podolsky electrodynamics.
              Inspired by previous studies where the Bopp-Podolsky field acts as
              a source for spherically symmetric solutions, we revisit this
